VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'uh it in but instead of talking back to centralized servers uh that user interface talks to your local Freenet pier and through your freet pier'

[21:51] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'interacts with contracts on the network and uh delegates storing local private data and so there\'s no there\'s no kind of'

[22:03] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'there\'s nothing like an app store with freet any more than there\'s an app store with the worldwide web that\'s unnecessary um although of course you don\'t ha you you\'re not limited to just using freenet'

[22:18] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'through your web browser you can also build native apps so for example we\'ve got a command line tool called riverctl that means that from the command line anything you can do in the river user'

